            "The Gate's merge tool is meant to read that line to decide whether a red job on a pull request may be carried. It does not yet, because the reviews found the gaps below. A wrong `only known reds` line is the worst fault this code can have, so every part fails closed: when in doubt the run reports a new red.\n\n"
